{"id":107,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Punches in corkscrew fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall like a drill."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby"],"text":"Hitmonchan is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working toward a world championship. This Pokémon has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"The spirit of a pro boxer has infused this Pokémon. It throws punches that are faster than a bullet train."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning-fast volleys that are impossible to see."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who aimed to become the world champion. Having an indomitable spirit means that it will never give up."},{"games":["Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working towards a world championship. This POKéMON has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"To increase the strength of all its punch moves, it spins its arms just before making contact."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"Punches in corkscrew fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall in the same way as a drill."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Iron Fist","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up punching moves."},{"name":"Inner Focus","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":0,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Brown","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":236,"name":"Tyrogue","condition":null,"children":[{"id":106,"name":"Hitmonlee","condition":"Lv. 20, Atk > Def","children":[]},{"id":107,"name":"Hitmonchan","condition":"Lv. 20, Atk < Def","children":[]},{"id":237,"name":"Hitmontop","condition":"Lv. 20, Atk = Def","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,409],[1,33],[1,116],[1,252],[1,270],[1,364],[4,183],[8,410],[12,197],[16,418],[21,501],[24,7],[24,8],[24,9],[28,97],[32,5],[36,370],[40,68],[44,264]],"machine":[97,396,226,34,280,339,523,370,811,38,409,89,227,283,203,263,7,374,411,264,416,270,8,282,67,490,118,189,398,182,240,156,179,157,317,184,214,444,164,241,129,14,36,269,851,168,675,9,885,918,253,410],"egg":[418,68,364,136,183,229,410],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3pt5-107","name":"Hitmonchan","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"107","artist":"DOM","img":"sv3pt5/107"},{"id":"swsh7-81","name":"Hitmonchan","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Common","number":"81","artist":"Uta","img":"swsh7/81"},{"id":"swsh1-95","name":"Hitmonchan","set":"Sword & Shield","date":"2020-02-07","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"95","artist":"Shigenori Negishi","img":"swsh1/95"},{"id":"sm9-74","name":"Hitmonchan","set":"Team Up","date":"2019-02-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"74","artist":"Tomokazu Komiya","img":"sm9/74"},{"id":"xy12-62","name":"Hitmonchan","set":"Evolutions","date":"2016-11-02","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"62","artist":"Ken Sugimori","img":"xy12/62"},{"id":"g1-48","name":"Hitmonchan","set":"Generations","date":"2016-02-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"48","artist":"